 .../cgroups/devices/ebpf_linux.go             | 51 ++++++++++---
 .../opencontainers/cgroups/devices/endian.go  | 20 -----
 3 files changed, 71 insertions(+), 74 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 vendor/github.com/opencontainers/cgroups/devices/endian.go

